2. Emit the asset, its maximum scan_at using an epoch baseline, the number of scans strictly after due_at, and the sum of whole days from origin_at to scan_at.
3. A null due_at means no deadline and contributes zero overdue scans. Count a scan once; equality with the deadline is on time. Reset all group state.

```ctl
//#CTL2
